 :established-date-note
 "Two sources, one day apart, both recorded rather than reconciled. FTI's own
  background page (https://fti.or.th/AboutUs/background) states that the
  government promulgated the Federation of Thai Industries Act B.E. 2530 in the
  Royal Gazette on 28 December B.E. 2530, raising ATI to become FTI under the
  supervision of the Minister of Industry. Wikipedia and Wikidata Q4924184 date
  the upgrade to 29 December 1987. Thai acts commonly take effect the day after
  promulgation, which would make both true, but no source consulted says so for
  THIS act, so the inference is not made here. The value above is the
  longer-standing one; the catalog carries both as separate entries with
  separate provenance."
 :statutory-basis "Federation of Thai Industries Act B.E. 2530 (1987)"
 :supervising-minister-role "Minister of Industry"
